-- 050: mosaic_draftable_metric_view re-created with business metadata (GENERATED by _enrich_metric_view_metadata.py from the
-- live definition + metric_view_metadata/mosaic_draftable_metric_view.json). Logic identical to live (asserted). edw_test only.
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW edw_test.enterprise_analytics.mosaic_draftable_metric_view
COMMENT 'MOSAIC DRAFTABLE / UNDRAFTED SEMANTIC LAYER (draft, edw_test only). Every Mosaic exam on a drafting-eligible RPID, classified into the PBI 8-category waterfall explaining why it was or was not drafted. Source = daily snapshot of the PBI Draftable table (examsnotdraftedbutdraftable_vw).'
WITH METRICS
LANGUAGE YAML
AS
$$
version: 1.1
source: edw_test.enterprise_analytics.mosaic_draftable_snapshot_mv
comment: MOSAIC DRAFTABLE / UNDRAFTED SEMANTIC LAYER (draft, edw_test only). Every Mosaic exam on a drafting-eligible RPID,
  classified into the PBI 8-category waterfall explaining why it was or was not drafted. Source = daily snapshot of the PBI
  Draftable table (examsnotdraftedbutdraftable_vw).
dimensions:
- name: Calendar Date
  expr: source.calendar_date
  comment: Exam calendar date (daily) - bind period filters here, e.g. Calendar Date between '2026-09-01' and '2026-09-30'.
    The snapshot keeps completed Mon-Sun weeks only.
  display_name: Exam Date
  synonyms:
  - day of exam
  - draftable exam date
  - calendar day
- name: Week Start
  expr: source.week_start_monday
  comment: Monday that starts the Mon-Sun week. The legacy/PowerBI column holding this is (mis)named week_end; PowerBI's own
    [Week Start] calc column (= week_end - 6) is a further 6 days earlier.
  display_name: Week Start (Monday)
  synonyms:
  - week
  - week of
  - week beginning
- name: Month
  expr: DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', source.calendar_date)
  comment: Calendar month of the exam date (first day of month, e.g. 2026-09-01). Use for monthly trends; PowerBI month visuals
    bucket by week instead - see PBI Month (by week).
  display_name: Exam Month
  synonyms:
  - month of exam
  - calendar month
  - monthly
- name: PBI Month (by week)
  expr: DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', source.week_start_monday)
  comment: 'Month bucket PowerBI uses (Draftable[Month Start] = month of week_end). Only for reproducing PowerBI month visuals:
    a week spanning a month boundary lands wholly in the month of its Monday.'
  display_name: PowerBI Month (By Week)
  synonyms:
  - pbi month
  - powerbi month bucket
  - week-based month
- name: Category
  expr: source.category
  comment: 'Why a draftable exam was or was not drafted, e.g. ''Drafted'', ''RAD not enabled - Rad declined'', ''Exam never
    opened, not drafted''. First match wins: Drafted > Rad declined > Ops declined > Incomplete process > PRACTICE not enabled
    > never opened > opened <5 min > opened >5 min. Sort by Category Sort Order.'
  display_name: Drafting Category
  synonyms:
  - reason not drafted
  - undrafted reason
  - why not drafted
- name: Category Sort Order
  expr: source.category_sort_order
  comment: 'Numeric sort key for Category: 0 = Drafted, 1 = Rad declined, 2 = Ops declined, 3 = Incomplete process, 4 = Practice
    not enabled, 5 = opened <5 min, 6 = opened >5 min, 7 = Exam never opened.'
  display_name: Category Sort Order
  synonyms:
  - category order
  - category number
  - waterfall position
- name: Category Group
  expr: CASE WHEN source.category = 'Drafted' THEN 'Drafted' WHEN source.category LIKE 'RAD not enabled%' THEN 'Radiologist
    not enabled' WHEN source.category = 'PRACTICE not enabled for model' THEN 'Practice not enabled' ELSE 'Enabled, draft
    not used' END
  comment: 'Owner-level roll-up of Category: ''Drafted'', ''Radiologist not enabled'' (consent / ops / enablement, categories
    1-3), ''Practice not enabled'' (model roll-out, 4), ''Enabled, draft not used'' (workflow / product, 5-7).'
  display_name: Drafting Category Group
  synonyms:
  - owner group
  - reason group
  - undrafted bucket
- name: Is Drafted
  expr: source.category = 'Drafted'
  comment: TRUE if the exam was drafted (Category = 'Drafted'); FALSE = undrafted (categories 1-7).
  display_name: Drafted Flag
  synonyms:
  - was drafted
  - draft used
  - drafted or not
- name: Team
  expr: source.Team
  comment: Radiologist's roster team, finer than Team Rolled Up (a sub-team of the Provider Practice, the rad's home practice).
    = PowerBI Draftable[Team].
  display_name: Team
  synonyms:
  - sub team
  - roster team
  - rad team
- name: Team Rolled Up
  expr: source.team_rolled_up
  comment: Provider Practice = the radiologist's home practice, rolled up via tbl_team_rollups (= PowerBI 'Team Rolled up').
    This view has no Managing Practice (exam-site practice); use this or Local Region for practice cuts.
  display_name: Provider Practice
  synonyms:
  - home practice
  - rolled up team
  - practice
  - group
- name: Local Region
  expr: source.local_region
  comment: One of 6 regions (Special Operations, Apex, Genesis, Maverick, Trailblazer, Matrix), exact copy of PowerBI Draftable[Localdraf]
    keyed on Team. Differs from other views' Local Region for a few teams (e.g. RP Florida West, RAA, Lakefront Imaging).
    Filter with equality.
  display_name: Local Region
  synonyms:
  - region
  - local
  - regional group
- name: Local Practice
  expr: source.local_practice
  comment: Exam's local practice short name (legacy local_practice = local_practice_short_name), a short site-group code.
    NOT Managing Practice and not Provider Practice - prefer Team Rolled Up or Local Region for practice questions.
  display_name: Local Practice Code
  synonyms:
  - site group code
  - local practice short name
- name: Site
  expr: source.site
  comment: Exam location - the imaging site / facility where the draftable exam was performed.
  display_name: Exam Site
  synonyms:
  - facility
  - imaging site
  - location
  - hospital
- name: Radiologist Name
  expr: source.Radiologist
  comment: Reading radiologist, 'Last, First M' (e.g. 'Taha, Manuel R'). Match partial names with ILIKE '%lastname%' and say
    which radiologist(s) matched.
  display_name: Radiologist Name
  synonyms:
  - radiologist
  - rad
  - doctor
  - physician
  - reading radiologist
- name: NPI
  expr: CAST(source.npi AS STRING)
  comment: Reading radiologist's NPI (National Provider Identifier), as text.
  display_name: Radiologist NPI
  synonyms:
  - provider npi
  - npi number
- name: Exam Category
  expr: source.exam_category
  comment: Exam category from exam_category_lookup_xwalk (ParentRpt) - the canonical grouping of procedure codes.
  display_name: Exam Category
  synonyms:
  - procedure category
  - exam type
  - study type
- name: Drafting Model
  expr: source.drafting_model
  comment: 'Declared AI drafting model / capturable category for the RPID: ''XR/MSK'', ''CT Chest'', ''CT Abd/Pel'', ''CT
    Spine'', ''CT Head'', ''US Capturable'', ''DEXA Capturable''.'
  display_name: Drafting Model
  synonyms:
  - ai model
  - draft model
  - model category
measures:
- name: Draftable Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count)
  comment: Denominator of every Pct measure, and the headline draftable volume - use directly for exam counts (e.g. ranked
    by Category). All Mosaic exams on drafting-eligible RPIDs, all 8 categories incl. Drafted. = PowerBI Draftable[Exam Count]
    (Mosaic Volume Report).
  display_name: Draftable Exams
  synonyms:
  - draftable volume
  - drafting opportunity
  - total draftable
  - exams eligible for drafting
- name: Draftable TBWU
  expr: SUM(source.tbwu)
  comment: 'Building block: denominator of Pct Undrafted TBWU. Workload (TBWU) of all draftable exams = PowerBI [Category
    Value] with Metric Selector = TBWU (Mosaic Volume Report).'
  display_name: Draftable Workload (TBWU)
  synonyms:
  - draftable workload
  - draftable rpwu
  - draftable work units
- name: Radiologist Count
  expr: COUNT(DISTINCT source.Radiologist)
  comment: Distinct reading radiologists with draftable exams, counted by name (not NPI). = PowerBI Draftable[Rad Count] (DISTINCTCOUNT
    Radiologist, Mosaic Volume Report).
  display_name: Radiologists With Draftable Exams
  synonyms:
  - rad count
  - number of radiologists
  - how many rads
- name: Undrafted Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category <> 'Drafted')
  comment: Numerator of Pct Undrafted; use directly for 'how many exams were not drafted'. Draftable exams that were not drafted
    (categories 1-7).
  display_name: Undrafted Exams
  synonyms:
  - not drafted exams
  - missed drafts
  - exams without a draft
- name: Undrafted TBWU
  expr: SUM(source.tbwu) FILTER (WHERE source.category <> 'Drafted')
  comment: 'Building block: numerator of Pct Undrafted TBWU. Workload (TBWU) of draftable exams that were not drafted.'
  display_name: Undrafted Workload (TBWU)
  synonyms:
  - undrafted workload
  - missed drafting workload
- name: Radiologists With Undrafted Exams
  expr: COUNT(DISTINCT source.Radiologist) FILTER (WHERE source.category <> 'Drafted')
  comment: Distinct radiologists (by name) with at least one undrafted draftable exam in the slice.
  display_name: Radiologists With Undrafted Exams
  synonyms:
  - rads with undrafted exams
  - rads missing drafts
- name: Drafted Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'Drafted')
  comment: Numerator of Pct Drafted; use directly for drafted exam counts. Exams in category 0 'Drafted'.
  display_name: Drafted Exams
  synonyms:
  - exams drafted
  - drafted volume
  - number drafted
- name: Rad Declined Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'RAD not enabled - Rad declined')
  comment: Numerator of Pct Rad Declined. Exams in category 1 'RAD not enabled - Rad declined' (the radiologist declined drafting).
  display_name: Rad Declined Exams
  synonyms:
  - rad declined count
  - radiologist declined drafting
- name: Ops Declined Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'RAD not enabled - Ops declined')
  comment: Numerator of Pct Ops Declined. Exams in category 2 'RAD not enabled - Ops declined' (operations declined enabling
    the radiologist).
  display_name: Ops Declined Exams
  synonyms:
  - ops declined count
  - operations declined
- name: Incomplete Process Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'RAD not enabled - Incomplete process')
  comment: Numerator of Pct Incomplete Process. Exams in category 3 'RAD not enabled - Incomplete process' (enablement / onboarding
    not finished - often the biggest single lever).
  display_name: Incomplete Process Exams
  synonyms:
  - incomplete enablement
  - onboarding not finished
- name: Practice Not Enabled Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'PRACTICE not enabled for model')
  comment: Numerator of Pct Practice Not Enabled. Exams in category 4 'PRACTICE not enabled for model' (model not yet rolled
    out to the practice).
  display_name: Practice Not Enabled Exams
  synonyms:
  - model not rolled out
  - practice not live for model
- name: Opened Under 5 Min Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in <5 min')
  comment: Numerator of Pct Opened Under 5 Min. Exams in category 5 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in <5 min' (opened
    before the draft was likely ready - latency).
  display_name: Opened Under 5 Min Exams
  synonyms:
  - draft not ready
  - opened too early
  - latency misses
- name: Opened Over 5 Min Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in >5 min')
  comment: Numerator of Pct Opened Over 5 Min. Exams in category 6 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in >5 min' (draft had
    time to arrive but was not used - adoption / workflow).
  display_name: Opened Over 5 Min Exams
  synonyms:
  - opened after 5 minutes
  - workflow misses
- name: Never Opened Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'Exam never opened, not drafted')
  comment: Numerator of Pct Never Opened. Exams in category 7 'Exam never opened, not drafted'.
  display_name: Never Opened Exams
  synonyms:
  - exams never opened
  - unopened exams
- name: Pct Drafted
  expr: MEASURE(`Drafted Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: 'Headline drafting coverage: share of draftable exams that were drafted, a fraction (0.42 = 42%). = PowerBI [Category
    % of Draftable] for Drafted (Mosaic Volume Report). Slice by Calendar Date / Month.'
  display_name: Drafting Coverage Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% drafted'
  - drafting coverage
  - coverage
  - draft rate
- name: Pct Undrafted
  expr: MEASURE(`Undrafted Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams not drafted, a fraction (= 1 - Pct Drafted).
  display_name: Undrafted Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% undrafted'
  - '% not drafted'
  - missed drafting rate
- name: Pct Rad Declined
  expr: MEASURE(`Rad Declined Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'RAD not enabled - Rad declined', a fraction. = PowerBI [Category % of Draftable] for
    that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
  display_name: Rad Declined Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% rad declined'
  - rad declined share
- name: Pct Ops Declined
  expr: MEASURE(`Ops Declined Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'RAD not enabled - Ops declined', a fraction. = PowerBI [Category % of Draftable] for
    that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
  display_name: Ops Declined Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% ops declined'
  - ops declined share
- name: Pct Incomplete Process
  expr: MEASURE(`Incomplete Process Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'RAD not enabled - Incomplete process', a fraction. = PowerBI [Category % of Draftable]
    for that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
  display_name: Incomplete Process Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% incomplete process'
  - incomplete process share
- name: Pct Practice Not Enabled
  expr: MEASURE(`Practice Not Enabled Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'PRACTICE not enabled for model', a fraction. = PowerBI [Category % of Draftable] for
    that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
  display_name: Practice Not Enabled Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% practice not enabled'
  - practice not enabled share
- name: Pct Opened Under 5 Min
  expr: MEASURE(`Opened Under 5 Min Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in <5 min', a fraction. = PowerBI [Category % of
    Draftable] for that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
  display_name: Opened Under 5 Min Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% opened under 5 min'
  - draft latency share
- name: Pct Opened Over 5 Min
  expr: MEASURE(`Opened Over 5 Min Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in >5 min', a fraction. = PowerBI [Category % of
    Draftable] for that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
  display_name: Opened Over 5 Min Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% opened over 5 min'
  - available draft unused share
- name: Pct Never Opened
  expr: MEASURE(`Never Opened Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'Exam never opened, not drafted', a fraction. = PowerBI [Category % of Draftable] for
    that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
  display_name: Never Opened Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% never opened'
  - never opened share
- name: Rad Not Enabled Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category LIKE 'RAD not enabled%')
  comment: Numerator of Pct Rad Not Enabled. Rad declined + Ops declined + Incomplete process exams (rad drafted <10% of the
    model's exams that week).
  display_name: Rad Not Enabled Exams
  synonyms:
  - radiologist not enabled exams
  - enablement losses
- name: Draft Not Used Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category LIKE 'DRAFT not available%' OR source.category = 'Exam never
    opened, not drafted')
  comment: 'Numerator of Pct Draft Not Used. Rad and practice enabled but no draft used: opened <5 min, opened >5 min, or
    never opened - the workflow / product bucket.'
  display_name: Draft Not Used Exams
  synonyms:
  - enabled but not drafted
  - workflow bucket exams
- name: Pct Rad Not Enabled
  expr: MEASURE(`Rad Not Enabled Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams lost to radiologist enablement (Rad declined / Ops declined / Incomplete process), a fraction
    of all draftable exams incl. Drafted.
  display_name: Rad Not Enabled Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% rad not enabled'
  - enablement gap
  - '% lost to enablement'
- name: Pct Draft Not Used
  expr: MEASURE(`Draft Not Used Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams where rad and practice were enabled but no draft was used (opened <5 min, >5 min, never
    opened), a fraction of all draftable exams incl. Drafted.
  display_name: Draft Not Used Pct
  synonyms:
  - '% draft not used'
  - workflow gap
  - '% enabled but undrafted'
- name: Pct Undrafted TBWU
  expr: MEASURE(`Undrafted TBWU`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable TBWU`), 0)
  comment: 'Workload-weighted undrafted share: undrafted TBWU / draftable TBWU, a fraction (= 1 - PowerBI [Category % of Draftable]
    for Drafted with Metric Selector = TBWU).'
  display_name: Undrafted Workload Pct (TBWU)
  synonyms:
  - '% undrafted workload'
  - tbwu weighted undrafted share
- name: Data Through Date
  expr: MAX(source.calendar_date)
  comment: Last calendar date in the snapshot (daily snapshot; the legacy view keeps completed Mon-Sun weeks only) - quote
    it as the as-of date.
  display_name: Data Through Date
  synonyms:
  - as of date
  - last data date
  - data freshness
$$
